@startuml sm3_game_page
!include style.iuml
title SM-3  GamePage (browser client) - state diagram
hide empty description
[*] --> Lobby
Lobby --> WaitingForOpponent : startGame()\n[mode = online and status = WAITING]
Lobby --> Playing : startGame()\n[status = IN_PROGRESS]\n(paired at once, or computer game)
WaitingForOpponent --> WaitingForOpponent : poll() every 1.5 s\n[status = WAITING]
WaitingForOpponent --> Playing : poll()\n[status = IN_PROGRESS]
WaitingForOpponent --> Lobby : leave()\n[player cancels]
Playing --> ShowingResult : poll() or play()\n[status = FINISHED]\n/ showResult()
Playing --> Lobby : leave()\n[player confirms quit]\n/ game forfeited
ShowingResult --> Lobby : backToLobby()\n[player clicks "Lobby"]
ShowingResult --> [*] : closePage()
Lobby --> [*] : closePage()
@enduml
